WEBVTT

00:43.460 --> 00:44.586
When I was in school,

00:44.669 --> 00:47.464
the owner of the stationery store nearby
had a dog.

00:49.090 --> 00:51.342
I think the name was Jjongjjong.

00:52.051 --> 00:53.344
Let's see.

00:55.472 --> 00:58.558
- How much is this?
- It's 500 won.

00:58.641 --> 01:00.060
- This one too?
- Yes.

01:01.144 --> 01:03.897
- There's one you can fly instead of that.
- Really?

01:03.980 --> 01:06.024
Jjongjjong seemed kind of cold.

01:10.487 --> 01:11.529
Where are you going?

01:12.822 --> 01:13.990
I'm walking Jjongjjong.

01:14.074 --> 01:16.451
You're the only one walking though.

01:17.702 --> 01:19.704
Jjongjjong likes being in my arms.

01:20.997 --> 01:21.831
See you.

01:25.627 --> 01:27.921
Jjongjjong was like royalty.

01:28.004 --> 01:29.631
WITH UNG

01:29.714 --> 01:31.341
- Hi, Ung.
- Hello.

01:32.509 --> 01:33.468
What?

01:34.636 --> 01:36.679
Did you have a baby?

01:39.933 --> 01:42.101
It seemed like an amazing life though.

01:42.602 --> 01:44.979
I've never seen him walk.

01:45.063 --> 01:46.648
He runs around at home though.

01:47.857 --> 01:49.359
My dream is to live like Jjongjjong.

01:52.278 --> 01:53.738
To tell you the truth,

01:54.322 --> 01:56.741
Jjongjjong was abandoned as a puppy.

01:56.825 --> 01:58.993
- So he's afraid of the outdoors.
- What?

01:59.077 --> 02:01.204
Maybe he was abandoned outside.

02:01.287 --> 02:02.872
He always acts like this outside.

02:04.666 --> 02:06.876
To be abandoned while on a walk…

02:07.544 --> 02:09.212
He must have been scared.

02:13.758 --> 02:18.179
So the reason why
I'm suddenly bringing this up is…

02:18.263 --> 02:19.681
I'm not going.

02:19.764 --> 02:21.558
I really don't get it.

02:21.641 --> 02:23.852
I'm really grateful for this opportunity,

02:24.435 --> 02:27.105
- but it's too far and it's for too long.
- Ridiculous.

02:27.188 --> 02:29.149
Your skills had improved greatly

02:29.232 --> 02:31.818
when you were gone there for six months.

02:31.901 --> 02:33.528
That's because it was six months.

02:34.112 --> 02:36.656
Living there for a few years is different.

02:36.739 --> 02:38.783
And I don't want to go there
all by myself.

02:39.367 --> 02:40.827
My goodness.

02:41.995 --> 02:44.038
I'll cancel my recommendation then.

02:51.129 --> 02:52.922
If that's why you don't want to go,

02:53.882 --> 02:56.301
then you can go with a friend.

03:05.643 --> 03:06.519
ENGLAND STUDY ABROAD PROGRAM

03:06.603 --> 03:08.646
What else is needed?
My GPA is pretty high.

03:08.730 --> 03:09.981
English scores? TOEFL?

03:10.064 --> 03:12.150
I can get that. I'm good at studying.

03:12.233 --> 03:14.736
Is there financial support?
Can I get a scholarship?

03:14.819 --> 03:16.195
What about living expenses?

03:18.656 --> 03:22.744
If I mention this to Yeon-su,
I'm sure she'll just tell me to go alone.

03:22.827 --> 03:24.329
But how can I be alone for years?

03:24.412 --> 03:26.331
So do you want to take Yeon-su?

03:26.414 --> 03:27.498
Just take me with you.

03:27.582 --> 03:31.044
There are a lot of schools
that Yeon-su could easily get into.

03:31.127 --> 03:33.963
She has a high GPA and everything.

03:35.632 --> 03:39.677
So I feel like it'd be nice for us
to go abroad and study together.

03:41.304 --> 03:43.014
But I have to be your manager.

03:43.514 --> 03:46.267
But I can't stop you
because it's such a good opportunity.

03:47.101 --> 03:49.103
So will you be living with Yeon-su there?

03:50.188 --> 03:53.066
What? Of course we'll be in a dorm…

03:56.069 --> 03:59.364
- Wait, would that be okay?
- Isn't it obvious that you should?

03:59.447 --> 04:01.157
You'll be in another country.

04:02.075 --> 04:04.244
You need to rely on each other there.

04:05.411 --> 04:07.580
You seem so excited.

04:07.664 --> 04:10.083
Wasn't that
what you were thinking in the first place?

04:10.166 --> 04:14.379
No. This is a decision I've made
solely for our future.

04:15.672 --> 04:17.590
And I have to ask Yeon-su first.

04:29.936 --> 04:31.187
Why would we break up?

04:36.276 --> 04:37.610
Why are you doing this?

04:41.739 --> 04:43.241
What reason do you have?

04:47.287 --> 04:49.622
Why do we have to break up?

05:18.818 --> 05:22.030
I'm sorry. What was I talking about?

05:23.114 --> 05:24.824
Oh, right. Jjongjjong.

05:37.670 --> 05:41.049
I often think about him these days.

05:41.716 --> 05:44.635
The way he decided to cope with his pain.

05:44.719 --> 05:47.722
See? We can be friends.

05:50.141 --> 05:51.517
I know it seems pathetic…

06:06.491 --> 06:10.286
but I'm acting
just like Jjongjjong these days.

06:22.048 --> 06:26.969
I don't think I can ever face
something I can't handle again.

06:31.599 --> 06:35.978
So I've chosen to do the same.

06:38.189 --> 06:39.440
Because nothing will happen

06:40.441 --> 06:41.943
if I don't do anything.

06:43.361 --> 06:50.368
EPISODE 11: OUR NIGHTS
ARE MORE BEAUTIFUL THAN YOUR DAYS

06:51.911 --> 06:53.162
Did you get home safe?

06:58.167 --> 07:01.546
Of course.
You practically shoved me inside.

07:01.629 --> 07:03.297
Thanks for being with me today.

07:03.923 --> 07:06.175
And for putting up with my boring stories.

07:16.269 --> 07:17.645
Call me anytime you need me.

07:36.330 --> 07:37.874
Did you stop by my place today?

07:49.343 --> 07:51.554
WE SPOTTED THE ARTIST GO-OH
SECRETLY MEETING NJ

08:02.440 --> 08:04.400
Why aren't we refuting the article?

08:05.276 --> 08:07.195
We don't have to respond to them all.

08:08.654 --> 08:10.323
But we always have.

08:10.406 --> 08:13.242
That's because you always dated lousy men.

08:13.326 --> 08:14.368
It doesn't make sense.

08:14.452 --> 08:18.998
You would rush to refute rumors
when I was actually dating those guys.

08:19.081 --> 08:21.083
So why aren't you refuting this article
when we're not even dating?

08:21.167 --> 08:23.794
Compared to your prior scandals,

08:23.878 --> 08:26.506
the public's response
to this one isn't so bad.

08:26.589 --> 08:28.758
And he has a pretty good reputation too.

08:29.300 --> 08:31.594
CEO KANG YEON-JU

08:31.677 --> 08:35.223
And you said you needed
a place to breathe.

08:36.766 --> 08:40.520
If that's what he is to you
then I can turn a blind eye.

08:40.603 --> 08:42.438
Blow off some steam by dating him

08:42.522 --> 08:44.440
and make sure
it won't interfere with work.

08:52.073 --> 08:55.076
Are you hoping this will pass over
like it did all the other times?

08:56.118 --> 08:58.663
Stop treating me like a little kid.

08:59.956 --> 09:01.332
You're too young to know--

09:01.415 --> 09:03.834
And I'm not seeing him to blow off steam.

09:03.918 --> 09:07.505
Can't you tell from the photo?
I'm the one who has a crush on him.

09:07.588 --> 09:09.757
All he does is give me more stress.

09:09.840 --> 09:12.927
So stop making stupid plans
and just leave him alone.

09:13.010 --> 09:15.513
Don't treat this like some candy
you're throwing at me.

09:15.596 --> 09:16.806
YEON ENTERTAINMENT

09:16.889 --> 09:19.475
He has nothing to do with my actions.

09:23.145 --> 09:28.818
"Regardless, NJ would visit his home
whenever she had any free time."

09:28.901 --> 09:33.114
"The two would enjoy a meal
at their favorite restaurant

09:33.197 --> 09:34.699
and go to her house."

09:36.284 --> 09:37.577
Her house?

09:38.578 --> 09:41.706
Isn't this funny?
They're saying you went to her house.

09:42.373 --> 09:45.710
There's no way that you'd go to her house.

09:47.003 --> 09:49.547
But look at this.

09:50.172 --> 09:52.216
It's you in front of her house.

09:52.300 --> 09:53.884
This is crazy, isn't it?

09:53.968 --> 09:55.219
Do you see this?

09:56.012 --> 09:59.473
And look. You're in this paparazzi shot.

09:59.557 --> 10:00.891
This is so interesting.

10:00.975 --> 10:01.976
Stop it.

10:03.477 --> 10:04.562
And…

10:05.396 --> 10:06.981
look at this.

10:07.064 --> 10:10.568
This is the first time
I've silenced my phone as your manager.

10:10.651 --> 10:13.863
I need to know something
if I have to answer all these journalists.

10:13.946 --> 10:16.907
But you wouldn't answer any of my calls.
So what could I do?

10:16.991 --> 10:17.950
Where's my phone?

10:19.076 --> 10:19.910
First…

10:22.204 --> 10:23.706
- tell me.
- What?

10:23.789 --> 10:25.958
- Tell me it's not true.
- It isn't.

10:27.084 --> 10:28.002
Really?

10:28.669 --> 10:30.338
All right, then.

10:30.421 --> 10:31.672
It's fine if it isn't true.

10:31.756 --> 10:34.216
I know it's not true. Right?

10:34.300 --> 10:35.885
This doesn't make sense.

10:35.968 --> 10:37.178
It's impossible.

10:37.261 --> 10:39.013
How can people believe this?

10:40.014 --> 10:41.932
It's ridiculous.

10:42.016 --> 10:44.060
Just tell them

10:44.810 --> 10:47.313
that we're not dating

10:48.898 --> 10:50.149
and that I'm just a fan.

10:51.984 --> 10:56.364
Jeez. This must be so hard for NJ.

10:56.447 --> 11:00.201
She helped us so much,
but we've ruined her reputation.

11:02.536 --> 11:04.497
Hey, where's my phone?

11:05.081 --> 11:07.708
You're asking me? I just came here.

11:07.792 --> 11:10.169
I'm sure it's somewhere in your studio.

11:17.927 --> 11:19.053
What?

11:22.890 --> 11:24.100
MISSED CALL, GU EUN-HO

11:25.726 --> 11:26.769
GU EUN-HO, FATHER, NJ

11:39.532 --> 11:43.369
Mr. Choi. Did you lose your phone
and just find it?

11:43.452 --> 11:45.079
How did you know?

11:45.579 --> 11:47.581
I think I know you a bit now.

11:49.500 --> 11:52.628
I just saw the article about us.
I'm sorry.

11:53.129 --> 11:55.548
I never thought about this kind of thing.

11:55.631 --> 11:57.925
I think I caused a lot of trouble for you.

11:58.592 --> 12:01.011
You could be the one in trouble though.

12:03.139 --> 12:05.808
My agency might not refute the article.

12:05.891 --> 12:09.353
I guess they think
that I have something to gain from this.

12:09.979 --> 12:12.356
They're trying to use your good image.

12:12.440 --> 12:14.483
So tell everyone it's not true.

12:14.567 --> 12:16.444
Tell them I'm just chasing you around.

12:17.111 --> 12:18.946
You need to teach my agency a lesson.

12:20.156 --> 12:23.325
I'm not sure I understand
what you're saying,

12:23.409 --> 12:25.494
but wouldn't that be bad for you?

12:26.495 --> 12:30.207
We should be celebrating
on a day like this.

12:30.291 --> 12:31.917
It's your first dating scandal.

12:34.211 --> 12:37.298
Too bad my schedule is too packed.

12:37.882 --> 12:39.717
I'll call you again next time.

12:39.800 --> 12:40.801
Okay.

12:48.100 --> 12:50.519
Yes, he's NJ's fan.

12:51.353 --> 12:54.940
What? A stalker? What are you saying?

12:55.900 --> 12:59.945
Why would he follow her to her house?
No, that's not…

13:01.030 --> 13:03.407
How dare you say that about him!

13:04.700 --> 13:05.743
What are you doing?

13:05.826 --> 13:07.870
Just leave it. Don't do anything.

13:08.579 --> 13:09.747
Why?

13:10.539 --> 13:12.500
Just wait until they release an article.

13:12.583 --> 13:13.584
Don't do anything yet.

13:15.085 --> 13:16.712
Why do you keep changing your mind?

13:18.964 --> 13:21.050
Hey, wait.

13:21.133 --> 13:24.303
You didn't just
talk to NJ about this, did you?

13:24.929 --> 13:29.183
I can't believe it.
How close are you to NJ?

13:31.393 --> 13:35.231
I never knew I'd actually ask this.

13:36.774 --> 13:38.526
What's going on between you two?

13:38.609 --> 13:41.111
Shut up. Just tell me what my schedule is.

13:42.905 --> 13:45.407
You're acting strange these days.
You're not the Ung I knew.

13:45.491 --> 13:47.493
You're not Ung, are you? Where did he go?

13:47.576 --> 13:49.870
Quit the nonsense, will you?

13:51.038 --> 13:52.373
You're busy this week.

13:52.456 --> 13:54.500
You have those interviews you postponed

13:54.583 --> 13:56.252
and you have documentary shoots.

13:56.335 --> 14:00.381
This Friday's going to be the last shoot.
Yeon-su will be there too.

14:03.342 --> 14:05.386
So it's finally coming to an end.

15:07.907 --> 15:11.577
I guess Ung delivered it to you.
You should've heated it up.

15:12.161 --> 15:13.996
That's good.

15:14.079 --> 15:16.206
Tell me if you want anything else.

15:16.874 --> 15:20.419
I made your favorite dishes,
but maybe it wasn't enough.

15:22.171 --> 15:23.213
Really?

15:24.214 --> 15:26.842
All right, you should get to work.

15:26.926 --> 15:29.053
Okay. Bye.

15:29.970 --> 15:31.722
Gosh, that brat.

15:31.805 --> 15:35.225
I don't know why he has a phone
if he's not even going to pick up.

15:35.309 --> 15:36.894
Did you call Ung again?

15:37.394 --> 15:39.897
Just leave him alone. He must be sleeping.

15:39.980 --> 15:42.316
He says he can't sleep well.

15:42.399 --> 15:45.069
His meds must be working. That's good.

15:45.152 --> 15:49.114
Darn it. He should give us a call though.

15:49.198 --> 15:51.075
I'm so curious.

15:52.159 --> 15:53.410
By the way,

15:53.494 --> 15:57.539
do you think there's really something
going on between him and that famous girl?

15:58.290 --> 16:00.709
I'm sure he'll take care of it himself.

16:00.793 --> 16:03.921
He said they're just friends,
so they must be. Plus…

16:06.465 --> 16:09.093
Ung has Yeon-su, you know.

16:09.176 --> 16:10.886
- Yeon-su?
- Yes.

16:11.512 --> 16:14.682
Is there something going on
between them again?

16:14.765 --> 16:16.684
Weren't they just going to be friends?

16:17.351 --> 16:20.062
I don't know. It's just what I think.

16:20.896 --> 16:22.356
Yeon-su…

16:23.107 --> 16:27.111
Right. Yeon-su's the perfect girl for Ung.

16:27.194 --> 16:29.029
- Right.
- Of course.

16:29.113 --> 16:30.656
Of course.

16:32.199 --> 16:34.910
It's fall already.

16:34.994 --> 16:36.203
You're right.

16:36.286 --> 16:39.123
NOW SERVING GIZZARDS, GRILLED OR SEASONED

16:43.585 --> 16:44.878
It's this week, right?

16:51.218 --> 16:55.014
I'll tell Ung
that we're going to visit the countryside.

16:55.639 --> 16:56.724
Okay.

17:12.573 --> 17:13.741
INCOMING CALL
SOL-I

17:16.535 --> 17:18.454
- Hey.
- Where are you?

17:18.537 --> 17:22.041
I'm going back to the office
after a meeting. Why?

17:22.124 --> 17:24.710
Nothing much.

17:24.793 --> 17:27.129
I'm hanging up if it's nothing.
I'm driving.

17:28.422 --> 17:29.673
Are they really dating?

17:29.757 --> 17:31.216
- Ung and NJ.
- Bye.

17:31.800 --> 17:33.093
Hey! You brat.

17:33.677 --> 17:36.555
- You didn't even ask him, did you?
- Why would I ask him?

17:37.806 --> 17:40.684
I'm sure you're letting your imagination
run wild right now.

17:40.768 --> 17:42.644
Me? No, of course not.

17:42.728 --> 17:46.106
I'm too busy with work
to think about such useless stuff.

17:46.190 --> 17:48.692
- You said you're driving.
- Bye.

18:17.387 --> 18:19.431
She's not Ung's type.

18:20.808 --> 18:21.975
She's pretty, but…

18:23.102 --> 18:25.270
Right, she is pretty.

18:26.063 --> 18:27.564
But her smile's a bit…

18:30.484 --> 18:32.277
And she's way too young.

18:42.996 --> 18:45.415
Ji-ung, what happened yesterday?

18:45.499 --> 18:48.377
Oh, sorry. Something came up.
Did you wait for me?

18:48.460 --> 18:50.712
Well, I had work anyway.

18:50.796 --> 18:52.881
But Mr. Choi waited for you.

18:55.425 --> 18:56.426
Ung was here?

18:56.510 --> 18:58.470
Yes, I told him you were coming soon

18:58.554 --> 19:01.014
so he waited
in the editing room for quite a while.

19:01.598 --> 19:03.016
He had some food for you.

19:08.147 --> 19:10.983
It was your birthday yesterday, right?
Happy birthday.

19:11.066 --> 19:13.652
I stopped Mr. Park
from throwing a surprise party.

19:13.735 --> 19:16.446
Good job. You're so sharp.

19:17.447 --> 19:19.700
- Are you going out to shoot?
- Mr. Choi has an interview

19:19.783 --> 19:21.368
so I'm going to shoot that.

19:21.451 --> 19:22.411
Ji-ung.

19:23.871 --> 19:27.416
If you have time after work tonight,

19:27.499 --> 19:28.917
let me take you out to dinner.

19:29.001 --> 19:30.961
It was your birthday yesterday.

19:31.044 --> 19:33.130
It's fine. Birthdays aren't a big deal.

19:33.213 --> 19:35.007
- I'll just--
- I want to treat you.

19:38.302 --> 19:40.846
Or at least a cup of coffee.

19:46.018 --> 19:49.479
All right. I'll make you not want to
buy me anything next year.

19:50.147 --> 19:51.648
- Good luck with your shoot.
- Okay.

19:59.948 --> 20:01.033
What?

20:01.575 --> 20:02.993
How long were you standing there?

20:04.870 --> 20:06.914
You told me to wait here.

20:08.790 --> 20:11.877
Oh, right. Did you get everything?

20:11.960 --> 20:13.045
Let's go.

20:13.128 --> 20:14.713
It's this way.

20:14.796 --> 20:15.964
I know.

20:49.039 --> 20:50.165
Mr. Choi.

20:51.708 --> 20:52.960
Mr. Choi?

20:54.378 --> 20:55.337
Oh, yes.

20:55.420 --> 20:58.548
Are you alright?
Was that a difficult question to answer?

20:58.632 --> 21:00.300
No, it's nothing.

21:00.884 --> 21:03.553
I'm sorry, but could you ask that again?

21:04.221 --> 21:06.974
You said you don't draw people
in your works.

21:07.057 --> 21:10.686
It feels like you've purposely
left people out of them.

21:11.478 --> 21:15.148
Like you've intentionally
left those spaces empty.

21:15.232 --> 21:19.278
We can feel loneliness and emptiness
in your drawings.

21:19.361 --> 21:21.947
I think that comes
from the exclusion of people.

21:22.030 --> 21:24.157
Is that intentional,

21:24.241 --> 21:26.910
or is this something
that you did subconsciously?

21:32.124 --> 21:36.670
It depends on the viewer
and their interpretation.

21:36.753 --> 21:39.339
I haven't thought of it that deeply.

21:39.423 --> 21:44.511
But sometimes, the artist's attitude
helps us understand their pieces.

21:45.679 --> 21:46.805
Well…

21:47.472 --> 21:49.683
I don't have the stories
you're looking for.

21:50.475 --> 21:51.810
Ma'am.

21:52.519 --> 21:56.565
Why don't you ask
about his exhibitions instead?

22:00.861 --> 22:05.157
It always feels like
I can't do an in-depth interview with you.

22:08.452 --> 22:09.619
Ma'am…

22:19.463 --> 22:22.382
You did look quite different
doing that interview.

22:25.302 --> 22:27.929
You should show this side of me more
in the documentary.

22:29.222 --> 22:31.224
By the way, I saw the article.

22:31.308 --> 22:35.437
Would there be a problem
with the footage we filmed of NJ?

22:35.520 --> 22:37.773
Well, it's fine with me,

22:37.856 --> 22:40.108
but you'll have to check with NJ's agency.

22:42.277 --> 22:45.155
But why aren't you asking
if the scandal is true or not?

22:46.114 --> 22:47.949
Do you think it's obviously not true?

22:50.994 --> 22:54.456
Is Ji-ung sending out clones
of him or what?

22:54.539 --> 22:56.666
You're so similar. It makes me feel weird.

22:57.459 --> 23:00.712
I'm sure you don't have room
to think about other people right now.

23:00.796 --> 23:02.964
You have your hands full with Ms. Kook.

23:03.882 --> 23:07.052
You shouldn't talk about
the casts' private lives like that.

23:07.636 --> 23:09.513
That's why I turned off the camera.

23:09.596 --> 23:11.973
Ji-ung would have said that on camera.

23:12.057 --> 23:16.311
- Is it off? I should see for myself.
- Didn't you see them in the editing room?

23:19.689 --> 23:22.025
I thought you saw Ji-ung's videos.

23:25.028 --> 23:27.739
I couldn't figure out what was what.

23:30.158 --> 23:31.451
We're done for today, right?

23:38.166 --> 23:39.167
I'm lonely.

23:40.001 --> 23:41.169
I'm so lonely.

23:42.295 --> 23:45.924
The position of CEO makes you so lonely.

23:46.967 --> 23:48.468
But as a leader,

23:48.552 --> 23:52.597
I guess I should accept my fate
to take responsibility

23:52.681 --> 23:55.058
and develop this company.

23:55.725 --> 23:57.352
You saw it just now, right?

23:58.270 --> 24:00.105
Everyone was having coffee without me

24:00.689 --> 24:02.607
and didn't let me join their conversation.

24:04.985 --> 24:05.986
Right?

24:07.529 --> 24:09.197
Ms. Kook, are you listening?

24:10.323 --> 24:11.575
Hello?

24:12.200 --> 24:15.245
Honestly, what did I do to them?

24:15.328 --> 24:18.081
Tell me. Am I such a bad person?

24:18.165 --> 24:21.960
Don't worry and be honest.
You can tell me anything.

24:23.211 --> 24:24.796
- Yi-hoon.
- Yes?

24:24.880 --> 24:27.257
You're just a little more clueless
than others.

24:27.340 --> 24:29.801
You're not a bad person.
You were like that in college too.

24:29.885 --> 24:31.845
Don't take it too personally.

24:35.682 --> 24:36.766
Me?

24:38.101 --> 24:39.728
I'm pretty quick-witted.

24:40.687 --> 24:43.607
I knew what the others
were talking about just a while ago.

24:43.690 --> 24:47.319
And I could've joined in on
the conversation smoothly too.

24:47.402 --> 24:51.323
They were talking
about Go-oh and NJ all day.

24:51.406 --> 24:56.161
What's the probability of your ex
ending up in a scandal with a celebrity

24:56.244 --> 24:59.748
They all want to know
if they're really dating or not.

24:59.831 --> 25:01.333
But they don't know anything.

25:02.375 --> 25:03.501
Should I tell you?

25:04.461 --> 25:05.754
Of course they're dating.

25:05.837 --> 25:08.882
Whatever the chances are,
one thing is for sure.

25:08.965 --> 25:11.468
- it feels very, very…
- When Go-oh saw NJ that day,

25:12.052 --> 25:13.178
he seemed dumbfounded.

25:13.762 --> 25:15.138
- …crappy.
- See?

25:15.222 --> 25:17.307
I'm pretty sharp, aren't I?

25:18.642 --> 25:20.477
You're right.

25:20.560 --> 25:22.938
So why don't you take a hint
and leave me alone?

25:23.021 --> 25:24.648
I'm working right now.

25:25.190 --> 25:27.025
Right. I'm leaving.

25:27.776 --> 25:28.777
Take it easy.

25:31.279 --> 25:32.530
I'm not that clueless.

25:32.614 --> 25:36.868
I have to hear about it
everywhere I go all day long.

25:37.911 --> 25:39.454
Throughout the entire day…

25:44.417 --> 25:46.253
it follows me everywhere.

25:49.673 --> 25:51.716
NJ really must be dating him this time.

25:51.800 --> 25:53.885
Right? Did you see the photo?

25:53.969 --> 25:55.720
- He's cute.
- Right.

25:55.804 --> 25:57.639
He's cute in his old photos too.

25:57.722 --> 25:59.849
That's why NJ fell for him.

26:00.475 --> 26:03.561
I don't want to hear or know about it.

26:10.944 --> 26:14.030
Right. Let's not pay it any attention.

26:23.540 --> 26:25.875
Excuse me, how much are these jujubes?

26:25.959 --> 26:27.919
It's 5,000 won per basket.

26:28.003 --> 26:29.129
I'll take one.

26:29.212 --> 26:30.422
All right.

26:31.965 --> 26:34.217
Don't you have any change?

26:35.468 --> 26:37.095
I'll take them all, then.

26:37.178 --> 26:40.140
Really? Thank you.

26:40.223 --> 26:45.812
But what would a young lady
be doing with so many jujubes?

26:45.895 --> 26:47.689
Jujube tea is good for insomnia.

26:48.606 --> 26:49.441
What?

26:50.775 --> 26:51.776
So they say.

26:52.777 --> 26:55.071
Is that so? Here you go.

26:55.739 --> 26:59.075
- Oh, no. Let me put it in another bag.
- Okay.

26:59.159 --> 27:00.160
Here.

27:02.037 --> 27:03.663
- Have a good day.
- Bye.

27:15.759 --> 27:17.427
Why did I buy these?

27:22.140 --> 27:24.351
We can go somewhere more expensive though.

27:24.434 --> 27:26.770
I was going to buy you something
really delicious.

27:27.354 --> 27:29.898
I eat a lot. You'll be surprised.

27:31.983 --> 27:33.151
Mr. Kim!

27:33.234 --> 27:35.070
Wait, Chae-ran's here too!

27:35.153 --> 27:38.823
Did you come here to eat?
What a coincidence!

27:39.491 --> 27:40.867
This is great!

27:41.451 --> 27:43.995
We're all gathered here together.

27:46.915 --> 27:49.042
Come sit with us.

28:00.136 --> 28:02.180
Why did I come here?

28:20.407 --> 28:22.826
Yes, I'll send… Oh, Yeon-su.

28:23.368 --> 28:26.037
I'm sorry.
I'll call you back after I check.

28:26.913 --> 28:29.958
- Are you here to see Ung?
- Yes, I needed to talk to him.

28:30.041 --> 28:31.418
Is he inside?

28:31.501 --> 28:32.627
He's not home.

28:32.710 --> 28:35.004
He's at the restaurant. Should I call him?

28:35.088 --> 28:37.841
No, it's fine. It's nothing urgent.
I can talk to him later.

28:37.924 --> 28:39.175
You came all the way here.

28:39.259 --> 28:41.261
- Go and wait inside.
- No, it's okay.

28:41.344 --> 28:44.347
You brought a lot of stuff too.
Come on. He'll be back soon.

28:45.014 --> 28:45.932
Here.

28:46.599 --> 28:48.476
Tell Ung that I left.

29:29.976 --> 29:33.396
We should have had
a company gathering earlier.

29:33.480 --> 29:36.399
And it was Mr. Kim's birthday yesterday.

29:36.483 --> 29:38.777
Isn't it nice to drink together like this?

29:38.860 --> 29:41.488
Your work's all going well, right?

29:41.571 --> 29:44.032
Mr. Kim, was it your birthday?

29:44.657 --> 29:46.910
I didn't know. Let me pour you a glass.

29:46.993 --> 29:49.454
I already drank enough.

29:49.537 --> 29:51.122
I can't drink as much as you.

29:51.206 --> 29:52.499
My goodness.

29:53.166 --> 29:55.293
You've worked here for so long,
but you can't drink?

29:55.376 --> 29:57.462
It's not like we drink while we work.

29:57.545 --> 29:59.255
Oh, jeez.

29:59.839 --> 30:02.425
I really can't get along
with people who don't drink.

30:02.509 --> 30:03.635
They're so boring.

30:04.219 --> 30:05.678
Work is what's most important.

30:05.762 --> 30:07.764
What you're shooting now is boring.

30:11.935 --> 30:15.271
He used to be okay
when he used to listen to my advice.

30:16.064 --> 30:19.776
But now he just does anything he wants.

30:19.859 --> 30:22.111
I don't think I ever did as you wanted.

30:22.779 --> 30:26.699
So tell me, do you really like
what you've shot this time?

30:27.867 --> 30:29.452
You don't, right?

30:30.078 --> 30:32.872
There's no way you've lost your touch.

30:32.956 --> 30:34.040
Right?

30:35.083 --> 30:36.709
No way.

30:36.793 --> 30:38.670
We were all having a good time.

30:39.295 --> 30:40.839
Why are you making him uncomfortable?

30:41.589 --> 30:44.300
Hey, Intern. Let's go.

30:44.384 --> 30:45.969
Oh, right. You quit.

30:46.052 --> 30:48.012
Finish your talk before the food arrives.

30:48.972 --> 30:50.932
And stop fighting in front of them.

30:51.015 --> 30:53.768
We're not fighting.
You know how much I like Mr. Kim.

30:54.435 --> 30:56.020
He doesn't like you though.

30:56.104 --> 30:58.481
Why are you always so harsh?

31:00.275 --> 31:01.818
I really can't understand her.

31:02.735 --> 31:06.030
Did he have to
overreact like that and embarrass me?

31:10.410 --> 31:11.744
Did I upset you?

31:13.538 --> 31:14.539
Sorry.

31:15.582 --> 31:19.794
Sometimes when I'm telling the truth,
my mouth moves faster than my head thinks.

31:20.503 --> 31:23.172
You're still saying that
you were telling the truth.

31:26.342 --> 31:27.844
You know it too though.

31:31.097 --> 31:32.140
What is it?

31:32.849 --> 31:34.350
What's the problem?

31:34.934 --> 31:38.521
I saw your draft, but I still don't get
what you're trying to say.

31:42.901 --> 31:44.402
You like Kook Yeon-su, don't you?

31:52.911 --> 31:54.370
What? No way.

31:55.330 --> 31:58.499
You really do. Was it because of that?

31:58.583 --> 32:00.627
This is finally getting interesting.

32:02.378 --> 32:04.756
Did you have to say that in front of her?

32:05.673 --> 32:08.134
- You knew too, right?
- Forget it.

32:09.344 --> 32:11.471
You just had to find out and embarrass me.

32:13.806 --> 32:16.059
That's the thing about cameras.

32:16.142 --> 32:20.605
They pretend to be objective observers,
but they're actually the most personal.

32:20.688 --> 32:22.523
The reason why I like you

32:22.607 --> 32:25.193
is because you pretend to be objective.

32:25.276 --> 32:28.279
But your works always
portray emotions very well.

32:28.947 --> 32:30.698
- You said it's boring.
- So I'm saying

32:31.699 --> 32:35.536
you should go and watch your footage
and edit it all again.

32:36.871 --> 32:41.042
I get that this is because
you're confused about your emotions,

32:41.834 --> 32:43.127
but come on.

32:44.253 --> 32:46.464
Why don't you follow
the gazes of the cast?

33:20.289 --> 33:21.833
MUSEUM OF AVANT-GARDE
PARIS, FRANCE

33:24.460 --> 33:26.629
CONCERNING VARIABILITY AND INVARIABILITY

33:45.815 --> 33:48.026
Hello. Nice to see you again.

33:48.776 --> 33:50.778
Oh. Right.

33:57.785 --> 33:59.037
Darn it.

34:00.079 --> 34:01.247
What?

34:50.088 --> 34:52.381
Congratulations on your scandal
with a superstar.

34:52.465 --> 34:54.300
Don't drink the wine. Keep it for later.

34:54.383 --> 34:55.927
Half of it is mine.

34:56.010 --> 34:58.513
P.S. Don't stay out so late.

35:52.567 --> 35:54.694
I've always wanted to ask you this.

35:57.822 --> 36:01.325
Am I getting between the two of you?

36:01.409 --> 36:03.911
- I don't want that.
- No.

36:05.371 --> 36:07.874
Nothing's going on between us right now.

36:08.499 --> 36:10.793
I see. "Right now"?

36:15.173 --> 36:16.424
The two of you…

36:20.887 --> 36:22.096
Never mind.

36:23.055 --> 36:26.184
As you've read in the articles,

36:26.267 --> 36:27.977
we're seeing each other.

36:33.524 --> 36:36.277
That's what I was thinking of saying,

36:36.360 --> 36:38.196
but that's just too cringy.

36:39.572 --> 36:41.991
There's no point
in the two of us talking about this.

36:42.575 --> 36:44.785
Mr. Choi would be so proud
if he sees this.

36:44.869 --> 36:46.913
He'll brag about it
for the rest of his life.

36:48.331 --> 36:50.333
I don't want to see him do that,

36:50.416 --> 36:52.001
so let's not fight.

36:53.669 --> 36:56.172
If I'm not getting in the way,
then it's fine.

36:56.255 --> 36:57.757
I'll figure it out.

37:11.646 --> 37:12.730
But…

37:14.190 --> 37:15.650
you won't stop

37:16.442 --> 37:17.693
if I ask you to.

37:25.451 --> 37:26.702
I know.

37:48.891 --> 37:50.393
What am I even doing?

38:24.093 --> 38:25.344
Did you drink again?

38:29.974 --> 38:33.728
I guess you enjoy drinking these days.
It's not like you.

38:39.108 --> 38:42.236
You should've gone home if you're drunk.
Why did you come here?

38:44.822 --> 38:46.741
Thanks for the food last time.

38:46.824 --> 38:50.703
Thank my mom, not me. Why are you here?

38:50.786 --> 38:51.996
Did you come to say that?

38:52.872 --> 38:54.290
I heard you came by the office.

38:55.082 --> 38:56.667
Yes, well…

38:56.751 --> 39:00.171
You always say you're busy
but you weren't at your desk.

39:05.676 --> 39:07.094
Just go to sleep.

39:07.970 --> 39:09.513
I'm going to work a bit more.

39:10.806 --> 39:12.099
Someone told me

39:14.477 --> 39:17.063
that everything I shoot
is full of emotions.

39:20.399 --> 39:22.318
And that it shows

39:22.401 --> 39:24.570
even when I try to hide it.

39:27.156 --> 39:28.366
Do you think so too?

39:31.077 --> 39:32.495
I don't get what you're saying.

39:39.502 --> 39:41.253
You saw everything.

39:45.383 --> 39:46.425
Didn't you?

39:53.974 --> 39:55.267
Well…

39:59.522 --> 40:00.815
I'm not sure.

40:00.898 --> 40:02.191
Wait.

40:03.818 --> 40:05.528
You're telling me not to mention it.

40:06.153 --> 40:07.154
Right?

40:08.864 --> 40:10.783
You're drunk. Just go to sleep.

40:14.328 --> 40:15.788
You're telling me to shut up

40:16.831 --> 40:18.332
because you don't want to know.

40:19.250 --> 40:20.251
Right?

40:33.973 --> 40:35.850
I knew this would happen,

40:38.477 --> 40:40.396
but I do feel pretty upset.

41:02.418 --> 41:05.004
Today won't be any special
even if it's our last shoot.

41:15.222 --> 41:17.183
Isn't it today?

41:18.392 --> 41:21.896
SEAFOOD SOUP WITH UNG

41:21.979 --> 41:23.856
Did you stay up or did you just wake up?

41:23.939 --> 41:28.027
Anyway, today's the last day of the shoot,
so get ready.

41:28.110 --> 41:29.778
I'll head over soon, okay?

41:29.862 --> 41:30.863
Okay.

41:35.534 --> 41:37.328
CLOSED TODAY

41:41.874 --> 41:43.792
Why isn't he picking up?

41:48.339 --> 41:51.217
Ji-ung, isn't Mr. Choi
doing whatever he wants

41:51.300 --> 41:53.677
because you're his friend?

41:53.761 --> 41:56.472
He went AWOL on the last day of the shoot.

41:56.555 --> 41:59.850
Why did he even agree to this
if he was going to take this so lightly?

41:59.934 --> 42:02.061
I'm so sorry.

42:02.144 --> 42:04.188
I even talked to him this morning.

42:04.271 --> 42:06.190
This isn't the first time.

42:06.273 --> 42:07.983
You should've checked properly.

42:08.067 --> 42:10.694
It seems like
he's not taking us seriously.

42:11.529 --> 42:12.780
I'm really sorry.

42:13.447 --> 42:16.325
I'll go wherever he could've gone
and bring him back.

42:16.408 --> 42:17.910
Forget it.

42:17.993 --> 42:22.122
Ji-ung. This is why
he's acting so selfishly.

42:24.833 --> 42:27.044
Let me apologize in his place.

42:27.127 --> 42:28.796
- Let's just call it a day here.
- Ms. Kook.

42:29.463 --> 42:32.424
Do you really not know?
Did something happen again?

42:32.508 --> 42:35.678
- Chae-ran!
- I'm sorry about last time.

42:36.720 --> 42:40.015
But nothing happened between us
this time. I haven't seen him in a while.

42:45.771 --> 42:47.064
Isn't it today?

42:52.236 --> 42:53.279
I'll bring him back.

42:53.946 --> 42:55.114
Do you know something?

42:55.197 --> 42:57.408
No, I'll look for him here and there.

42:59.743 --> 43:00.869
I'll look for him too.

43:05.082 --> 43:08.294
Ji-ung, you're going too easy on Mr. Choi.

43:09.086 --> 43:11.255
Even if he's your friend,
this is going too far.

43:12.798 --> 43:13.632
Well…

43:15.759 --> 43:17.803
I kind of feel like
maybe I chased him away.

43:18.387 --> 43:19.263
What?

43:36.864 --> 43:39.116
Hey, Ung!

43:39.199 --> 43:40.743
Hello.

43:40.826 --> 43:42.411
It's been such a long time.

43:42.494 --> 43:44.872
You haven't visited
ever since you graduated.

43:44.955 --> 43:48.584
It's so nice to see you again.
You should come more often.

43:51.462 --> 43:53.005
I don't see Jjongjjong.

43:53.088 --> 43:54.882
Oh, Jjongjjong?

43:54.965 --> 43:56.300
He went far away.

43:58.886 --> 44:02.514
Oh, I see. I'm sorry, I was just…

44:02.598 --> 44:05.225
Oh, there he is.

44:06.101 --> 44:09.897
He must have had an amazing walk.

44:09.980 --> 44:11.440
You should take a bath today.

44:13.776 --> 44:17.029
- Thanks.
- I'll take care of Jjongjjong's walks.

44:18.113 --> 44:20.115
He's so cute.

44:20.199 --> 44:21.450
- Bye.
- Bye.

44:23.619 --> 44:27.373
Didn't Jjongjjong hate going outside?

44:27.456 --> 44:30.125
That was a long time ago.

44:30.209 --> 44:32.378
He hates staying inside now.

44:33.629 --> 44:36.173
I see. Since when?

44:36.256 --> 44:37.925
How did you do it?

44:38.008 --> 44:40.594
I didn't do anything.

44:41.804 --> 44:43.430
It was all him.

44:44.223 --> 44:45.808
Right, Jjongjjong?

44:52.690 --> 44:53.774
You traitor.

45:11.917 --> 45:12.793
EDITING ROOM

45:20.926 --> 45:24.596
I get that this is because
you're confused about your emotions,

45:25.097 --> 45:26.306
but come on.

45:27.266 --> 45:29.476
Why don't you follow
the gazes of the cast?

45:53.917 --> 45:56.712
Hey. I still haven't found him.
What about you?

45:56.795 --> 45:58.714
I couldn't reach his parents either,

45:58.797 --> 46:01.758
so I asked the hardware store owner.
They went to the countryside.

46:02.551 --> 46:06.013
He's not at the bookstore or the library.
I can't find him anywhere.

46:06.096 --> 46:07.514
He's determined to stay hidden.

46:07.598 --> 46:11.268
He won't be where he goes often.
He's probably at an unexpected place.

46:11.852 --> 46:13.687
Anyway, call me if you find him.

46:19.818 --> 46:21.445
Oh, my goodness!

46:21.528 --> 46:25.574
You scumbag! Watch where you're going!

46:27.576 --> 46:28.994
I almost had a heartattack.

46:33.665 --> 46:35.209
Let me carry that for you.

46:35.292 --> 46:37.669
No, it's fine.

46:37.753 --> 46:41.131
It looks heavy.
I'll carry it to your home.

46:41.215 --> 46:43.342
I told you, it's fine.

46:43.425 --> 46:46.136
- Then until the bus station…
- I said, it's fine!

46:46.220 --> 46:47.971
Why are you doing this?

46:51.183 --> 46:52.267
Oh, no…

47:13.914 --> 47:15.541
Leave it there.

47:18.835 --> 47:21.797
You're drying a lot of jujubes.

47:25.801 --> 47:27.052
Who knows what they're for?

47:27.135 --> 47:30.847
Yeon-su bought so much and put them there.

47:30.931 --> 47:34.977
She keeps making jujube tea.
I don't know who it's for.

47:40.482 --> 47:44.653
This is jujube tea. I know you have
a hard time falling asleep…

47:44.736 --> 47:46.530
I mean, they told me to give it to you.

47:55.247 --> 47:57.457
My goodness…

48:00.919 --> 48:05.674
If Yeon-su did anything bad to you,

48:05.757 --> 48:07.884
it's all my fault.

48:08.635 --> 48:10.470
So don't hate her too much.

48:11.388 --> 48:12.973
We were poor,

48:13.932 --> 48:16.351
so I made her grow up to be selfish.

48:19.563 --> 48:24.359
It's my fault that she talks so harshly.

48:25.277 --> 48:28.155
And has a nasty temper too.

48:28.739 --> 48:33.160
So if you're upset at her about something,

48:34.036 --> 48:36.163
blame me for it

48:37.873 --> 48:39.708
and don't hate her.

48:46.214 --> 48:47.966
Yeon-su's not like that.

48:51.470 --> 48:53.597
That's not who she is.

48:54.514 --> 48:55.599
She's…

48:57.517 --> 48:58.644
a good person.

49:01.647 --> 49:03.940
She's so brilliant
I feel like I don't deserve her.

49:05.901 --> 49:08.904
If you know that,

49:09.780 --> 49:11.156
then what are you two doing?

49:14.117 --> 49:15.202
You're right.

49:17.162 --> 49:18.955
I knew I was pathetic,

49:20.999 --> 49:23.710
but I guess I've hit rock bottom today.

49:41.186 --> 49:42.396
Choi Ung.

49:45.023 --> 49:47.609
Stop this and come out already.

49:58.787 --> 50:00.706
Ji-ung, should I order dinner?

50:04.376 --> 50:05.335
Ji-ung…

50:18.056 --> 50:23.061
EDITING ROOM

50:29.025 --> 50:32.779
I think it's better to do something
you're good at

50:32.863 --> 50:35.824
than something you like.

50:35.907 --> 50:39.327
That way, you'll be more efficient
and get what you want.

51:30.420 --> 51:32.672
I had a hard time finding you this time.

51:40.555 --> 51:41.765
How did you find me?

51:41.848 --> 51:44.684
I just looked everywhere.

51:52.317 --> 51:54.653
Yes, it was this time of the year

51:54.736 --> 51:56.446
when you would disappear without a word.

51:57.239 --> 51:59.699
And your parents would disappear too.

52:01.701 --> 52:04.287
I forgot about it,
and I just remembered today.

52:06.373 --> 52:09.459
This is great. I wanted to do this.

52:11.545 --> 52:15.006
Drinking with you face to face, I mean.

52:52.836 --> 52:54.421
You're not avoiding me now?

52:57.007 --> 52:58.675
You're not even telling me to leave.

53:01.761 --> 53:02.971
I never avoided you.

53:04.472 --> 53:06.349
Then did I just imagine things?

53:33.168 --> 53:34.294
You're quiet.

53:42.552 --> 53:43.720
What should I say?

53:47.891 --> 53:51.061
Anything besides beating around the bush,

53:51.686 --> 53:53.229
avoiding the topic

53:54.522 --> 53:56.024
or something that'd hurt me.

54:06.326 --> 54:08.370
You must have decided to keep quiet again.

54:11.331 --> 54:13.041
I'll do the talking this time then.

54:33.520 --> 54:34.854
Well…

54:38.566 --> 54:39.734
I…

54:42.404 --> 54:45.782
About how you wanted us to be friends…

54:50.662 --> 54:52.664
I gave it some thought.

54:55.959 --> 54:57.252
I don't think I can do that.

55:01.214 --> 55:02.173
So…

55:03.341 --> 55:05.552
I don't mean
that I don't want to be friends.

55:08.513 --> 55:09.764
I…

55:11.975 --> 55:14.227
I just…

55:16.688 --> 55:17.939
I missed you.

55:18.982 --> 55:20.066
Yeon-su.

55:26.656 --> 55:29.117
I've always missed you.

55:35.915 --> 55:37.208
I…

55:38.668 --> 55:39.919
missed you.

55:47.802 --> 55:49.637
When I saw you again,

55:52.766 --> 55:56.019
I kept feeling angry for some reason
even though you were back.

55:58.897 --> 56:00.482
And I resented you.

56:04.778 --> 56:06.571
But I think I know why now.

56:10.158 --> 56:11.242
I guess…

56:12.827 --> 56:14.954
I wanted to see you love me.

56:21.086 --> 56:22.253
I wanted…

56:27.342 --> 56:29.719
to see you love only me.

56:45.735 --> 56:46.820
Yeon-su.

56:51.116 --> 56:52.242
Yes?

56:54.661 --> 56:56.329
Please keep loving me.

57:00.625 --> 57:01.918
Don't let go…

57:03.920 --> 57:04.921
and keep…

57:06.798 --> 57:07.882
loving me.

57:16.516 --> 57:17.600
Please.

57:43.626 --> 57:50.383
OUR NIGHTS ARE MORE BEAUTIFUL
THAN YOUR DAYS

58:08.860 --> 58:11.821
EPILOGUE

58:14.324 --> 58:16.659
- Yeon-su.
- Yes?

58:17.994 --> 58:20.830
Do you know how to see
the top of that building?

58:21.456 --> 58:23.875
You can go up to a different building.

58:23.958 --> 58:25.335
No, you got it wrong.

58:29.088 --> 58:31.966
Hey, are you that drunk?

58:35.178 --> 58:36.721
I heard this is how you do it.

58:37.305 --> 58:39.599
What simpleton said that?

58:40.225 --> 58:41.309
My dad.

58:42.143 --> 58:44.479
I knew it. He's so wise.

58:57.116 --> 58:58.409
I can't see it though.

58:58.493 --> 59:01.079
Right? That's what I told him.

59:02.038 --> 59:03.248
When was that?

59:06.042 --> 59:08.920
When I was about five? Six?

59:11.089 --> 59:13.132
He was just teasing you then.

59:20.431 --> 59:21.933
Not my current dad.

59:25.436 --> 59:26.271
What?

59:26.980 --> 59:28.231
My real dad.

59:32.193 --> 59:33.778
Of course he was teasing me.

59:34.279 --> 59:36.948
He told a little kid to lie down

59:37.615 --> 59:40.118
and count to the top floor.

59:42.036 --> 59:43.871
I didn't even know how to count then.

59:45.164 --> 59:46.791
I kept repeating

59:47.917 --> 59:49.877
one and two

59:51.337 --> 59:52.714
then I eventually got back up.

59:56.801 --> 59:57.969
When I did,

59:59.804 --> 01:00:02.390
my dad was gone.

01:00:11.733 --> 01:00:12.650
Ung.

01:00:14.360 --> 01:00:15.528
Isn't that funny?

01:00:17.405 --> 01:00:18.823
How could he…

01:00:21.451 --> 01:00:23.453
abandon me like that?

01:01:27.433 --> 01:01:32.438
Subtitle translation by: Ju-young Park
